From 8c71c17eb103dae254a23e88edc8c447c692e8e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 10:31:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add new MultiDDNS logo (favicon, web UI header,
 README/LIESMICH)

- docs/logo.png: full lockup (EiTiFuzzi mark + "MultiDDNS" wordmark on
  blue gradient card), embedded at the top of README.md and LIESMICH.md
- app/web/static/multiddns-icon.png: square crop of just the EiTiFuzzi
  mark (white rounded card), used as the small brand icon in the web
  UI header/sidebar (base.html, auth_base.html), replacing the old SVG
  reference there
- app/web/static/favicon.ico, favicon-512.png, apple-touch-icon.png:
  generated from the same square icon, wired up via <link rel="icon">
  / <link rel="apple-touch-icon"> in base.html and auth_base.html

The original app/web/static/etf-multiddns-logo.svg is left untouched
and unreferenced for now, per request, for later reuse.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WGndmt7YckJH1c3oLyMKZa
